{"id":908304,"title":"01｜课程的设计思路与智能体的发展路线","content":"本课程聚焦于深度思考智能体技术的发展与实战，采用总分总的结构设计。首先介绍了课程背景，从2023年初OpenAI的DeepResearch到国内Manus、扣子空间等通用智能体产品的兴起，再到Vibe Coding产品如雨后春笋般涌现。接着阐述了课程设计思路，以扣子空间为标杆，通过剖析其设计模式（计划模式、反思模式）、工具使用及综合应用来实现DeepResearch效果，并结合多智能体多模态项目进行实践。智能体技术发展历程从Function Calling开始，逐步引入记忆机制和多种设计模式，最终形成深度思考智能体。推荐使用国内大模型如GLM-Flash、通义千问Max系列、DeepSeek-R1和豆包大模型进行开发测试，强调了国内模型在实际应用中的重要性。课程旨在帮助学员掌握智能体技术原理及其在真实项目中的应用能力。","comments":[{"had_liked":false,"id":402438,"user_name":"John","can_delete":false,"product_type":"c3","uid":4318175,"ip_address":"甘肃","ucode":"6188FA7EF15037","user_header":"https://thirdwx.qlogo.cn/mmopen/vi_32/Q0j4TwGTfTLyxI8Q0XqyehqoGZe2P1BGtfNS4BkhD4kv06CSrw5iaTAX6ViarQataCQJOicJN85Dv0WLwzsER1Deg/132","comment_is_top":false,"comment_ctime":1757412368,"is_pvip":false,"replies":[{"id":146307,"content":"没看懂你的问题，Deepseek天气是啥？","user_name":"作者回复","user_name_real":"编辑","uid":1943646,"ctime":1757568537,"ip_address":"江苏","comment_id":402438,"utype":1}],"discussion_count":2,"race_medal":0,"score":2,"product_id":101074901,"comment_content":"最后DeepSeek天气粘过去应该会显示，402显示没有额度吧？老师请问这个额度推荐购买一下吗？","like_count":2,"discussions":[{"author":{"id":1943646,"avatar":"https://static001.geekbang.org/account/avatar/00/1d/a8/5e/791d0f5e.jpg","nickname":"最后的风之子","note":"","ucode":"45D5487480A5D2","race_medal":0,"user_type":2,"is_pvip":false},"reply_author":{"id":0,"avatar":"","nickname":"","note":"","ucode":"","race_medal":0,"user_type":1,"is_pvip":false},"discussion":{"id":671283,"discussion_content":"没看懂你的问题，Deepseek天气是啥？","content_length":21,"likes_number":0,"is_delete":false,"is_hidden":false,"ctime":1757568537,"is_liked":false,"can_delete":false,"is_complain":false,"is_top":true,"parent_id":0,"ip_address":"江苏","group_id":0,"attachments":[]},"score":2,"extra":"{\"reply\":true,\"user_type\":2,\"source\":0}","child_discussion_number":0,"child_discussions":[]},{"author":{"id":4318175,"avatar":"https://thirdwx.qlogo.cn/mmopen/vi_32/Q0j4TwGTfTLyxI8Q0XqyehqoGZe2P1BGtfNS4BkhD4kv06CSr